---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Enterprise Data Integration | Higor Lima"
  description="A generalized case study of business analysis work on an enterprise data integration initiative."
>
  <article class="page-shell interior-page project-case">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> Selected project · Business analysis</p>
    <h1>Enterprise Data<br /><em>Integration.</em></h1>
    <p class="page-lead">Business analysis for an initiative to connect data across separate business systems.</p>

    <div class="project-facts" aria-label="Project summary">
      <div><span>Role</span><strong>Business Analyst</strong></div>
      <div><span>Focus</span><strong>Requirements and data integration</strong></div>
    </div>

    <section class="project-section" aria-labelledby="context-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Context</p>
      <h2 id="context-heading">Bringing disconnected data into alignment.</h2>
      <p>The initiative addressed fragmented data across separate business systems. The work focused on clarifying business needs and defining how information should be mapped and transformed for integration.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="project-section" aria-labelledby="contribution-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Contribution</p>
      <h2 id="contribution-heading">Turning business needs into clear delivery requirements.</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Gathered and documented business and functional requirements.</li>
        <li>Mapped data fields across multiple source systems.</li>
        <li>Defined transformation rules to support data exchange between systems.</li>
        <li>Contributed data definitions and business logic to a shared data model.</li>
        <li>Created user stories for technical delivery teams and collaborated with engineers, modelers, developers, and data specialists.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="project-section" aria-labelledby="deliverables-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Deliverables</p>
      <h2 id="deliverables-heading">A shared foundation for implementation.</h2>
      <p>Work products included requirements documentation, field mappings, transformation rules, shared data definitions, and delivery-ready user stories.</p>
    </section>

    <p class="project-disclosure">This public summary is generalized and omits organization, client, project, platform, system, vendor, and technology identifiers.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href={`${base}/projects/`}>← Back to projects</a>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
